WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.052
Surfaces fit in four dimensions.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.021
Start small, inside a tiny sphere, then add

3
00:00:05.021 --> 00:00:06.965
wiggles to make up the missing length.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.086
Each round of wiggles shrinks what is missing, until nothing is.

5
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:17.473
Claimed: every closed surface, exactly isometric.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.946
Checked in Lean.
